subject_definitions:
<Subject 1> — 钱经理: a 45-year-old male property manager. Slightly overweight, slicked-back oily hair, round face, an ingratiating smile that flips into a scowl, white shirt buttoned up to the closed collar under a dark grey buttoned waistcoat, dark grey trousers and black leather shoes. His voice is loud, nasal and bullying, standard Mandarin. It is the person shown in <Picture 1>.
<Subject 2> — 苏小满: a 25-year-old female cleaner. Preserve her exact face, small lean build, centre-parted black hair in a low practical ponytail, plain dark-navy button-up work shirt buttoned up to the closed collar with its own small plain buttons down the front, a worn grey apron over dark navy trousers, black cloth shoes. Her voice is low, steady and slightly hoarse, standard Mandarin. It is the person shown in <Picture 2>.
<Subject 3> — 小唐: a 22-year-old female cleaning-team colleague. Thin, pale, narrow shoulders, shifty sidelong eyes, hair tied back in a low ponytail, light-grey button-up work shirt with a pointed collar and matching light-grey trousers, a light-grey apron tied round her waist, black cloth shoes. Her voice is small, thin and nervous. It is the person shown in <Picture 3>.

<Picture 4>: the office layout reference for 万山大厦 — this same single room is the set for the whole clip. Light-oak storage cabinets along the back-left wall with plain brown cardboard boxes stacked on top; a low wooden credenza under the back window with a printer, files and two potted green plants; an L-shaped wooden office desk with a black monitor, keyboard and document tray in the middle of the room, a black swivel chair pushed in; a grey fabric sofa with wooden armrests and a low wooden coffee table under the long window on the right; an open doorway with a grey metal frame on the left. Pale grey polished tile floor, white acoustic ceiling with recessed light panels.

summary:
[reference generation] The manager narrows it down to one person, staring across the desk; she denies it flatly and without heat.

retention_analysis:
<Subject 1> — 钱经理: fully_preserved - his slicked-back oily hair, round face and dark grey buttoned waistcoat over a white shirt are retained in every shot.
<Subject 2> — 苏小满: fully_preserved - her centre-parted black hair in a low practical ponytail, dark navy button-up work shirt and worn grey apron are retained in every shot.
<Subject 3> — 小唐: fully_preserved - her hair tied back in a low ponytail, light-grey work shirt and light-grey apron are retained in every shot.
<Picture 4>: fully_preserved - light-oak cabinets, L-shaped desk, grey sofa on the right, doorway on the left

detailed_description:
HORIZONTAL 4:3 landscape framing, high-key commercial cinematography on a large-format camera, soft broad daylight, luminous pale walls, light reflective floor, every surface clearly readable, airy and open, gentle soft shadows that stay light and keep their detail, clean luminous image, shallow depth of field, refined natural faces, elegant wardrobe, subtle film grain. Keep the film texture, natural lighting, every face, every costume and the realistic motion consistent throughout. People stay standing, framed from the knees up. The camera is locked off for the whole clip: the framing never changes and the size of everything in frame stays the same from the first frame to the last. All movement comes from the people inside the fixed frame.
Exposure: the window is a large bright key light and the whole room is filled with soft bounced daylight. Skin tones are bright and even. Shadow areas sit in the light mid-tones and keep visible texture and colour. The darkest corners of the frame still read as pale grey with detail, the whites stay white, and the picture carries an even, transparent, high-key brightness from edge to edge.
Every shirt and waistcoat is buttoned right up to the closed collar, so each chest shows one continuous unbroken run of plain fabric with its own small plain buttons down the front. Apron bibs are plain unmarked fabric.
Speaker labels for this shot only: (S1) 钱经理, (S2) 苏小满, (S3) 小唐. Anyone not named here stays completely silent with a closed mouth.
The whole clip takes place in the one office shown in <Picture 4>, and the three of them hold these same standing places from the first frame to the last: 钱经理 (S1) behind the L-shaped desk in the middle of the room, his body square to the desk and his head turned to the right towards 苏小满 (S2) at the near left corner of that desk, looking straight at her; 苏小满 (S2) at the near left corner of that desk in right profile facing right towards him, both feet flat on the tile; 小唐 (S3) on the right side of the room beside the grey sofa in left profile, facing left towards the desk.
ONE CONTINUOUS TAKE, medium two-shot on 钱经理 (S1) and 苏小满 (S2) across the corner of the L-shaped desk, framed from the knees up, camera locked off for all ten seconds: 苏小满 (S2) stands at the near left corner of the desk in right profile facing right towards him, both feet flat on the tile, her grey apron hanging straight down the front of her navy work shirt; she keeps her weight even and does not step and does not move her hands, and she speaks in a low steady slightly hoarse voice with her mouth opening and her jaw moving clearly as she answers him: 苏小满 (S2) speaks: [Chinese] 收台的时候，就你一个人在。 钱经理 (S1) sits on the far side of that desk corner with his body square to the desk and his head turned to the right towards her at that corner, looking straight at her; he keeps both hands flat on the wood and his mouth closed the whole time and he listens without moving. The framing never changes once: the same two people stay visible in the same two places at the same size from the first frame to the last, and the open doorway at frame left shows only the corridor wall beyond it.

No slow-motion, no soft dissolves, no fades, no unnecessary transitions; ⛔ The clip is shot as one single unbroken take with no cuts at all: the camera never cuts away, never changes lens, never changes height, and never changes framing. No slow-motion, no soft dissolves, no fades, no camera moves, and no on-screen text, letters, logos, subtitles, or watermarks.

overall_soundscape: A clock ticking on the wall and the low hum of the ceiling lights throughout; a short inhale from 钱经理 at 1.1s before he speaks; one nervous swallow from 小唐 at 5.2s; the soft scrape of a shoe on the floor at 6.8s as she steps forward.

non_diegetic_music: A low sustained string drone begins at 0s, a single muted cello note enters at 1.3s when he starts speaking, and the track thins to a single held note from 5.0s.
